## DECISION MATRICES (Embedded in Phase 4)

### Matrix 1: Sync REST vs Async Platform Event vs Change Data Capture

| Criterion | Sync REST | Async Platform Event | Change Data Capture (CDC) |
|-----------|-----------|---------------------|---------------------------|
| **Volume tolerance** | Low (≤100 TPS sustained) | High (10K+ events/sec) | High (record-change driven) |
| **Latency requirement** | Real-time (<1s round trip) | Near-real-time (1-5s) | Near-real-time (1-5s) |
| **Payload size** | Small-medium (<6MB) | Small (≤1MB per event) | Small (record delta) |
| **Receiver availability** | Must be up | Subscriber catches up | Subscriber catches up |
| **Replay/recovery** | Requires app-level retry | Built-in (replay ID, 72h) | Built-in (replay ID, 72h) |
| **Order guarantee** | Per-call | No (use sequencing field) | Per-record |
| **Best for** | Lookups, real-time queries, low-volume CRUD | High-fanout notifications, bulk async work | Replicating SFDC record changes outbound |
| **Anti-pattern** | High-volume bulk loads, fire-and-forget | Single-consumer point-to-point | Custom logic that mutates CDC record |

### Matrix 2: Salesforce-Native vs Middleware (Flow/Apex vs MuleSoft/Boomi)

| Criterion | SFDC-Native (Flow + Apex) | Middleware (MuleSoft / Boomi / etc.) |
|-----------|---------------------------|--------------------------------------|
| **# of external systems** | 1-2 | 3+ |
| **Transformation complexity** | Simple field-level | Complex (schema mapping, lookups) |
| **Governance** | Within SFDC change set / DevOps Center | Enterprise integration governance |
| **Reusability across orgs** | Per-org code | Cross-org / cross-business-unit |
| **Operational team** | SFDC dev/admin | Dedicated integration team |
| **Best for** | Single SFDC ↔ external sync, simple mapping | Hub-and-spoke, complex orchestration |
| **Anti-pattern** | Hub-and-spoke for >2 systems in Apex | Trivial 1-to-1 sync that Flow handles natively |

### Matrix 3: Industry Cloud Object vs Custom Object vs vlocity FSC

| Criterion | Industry Cloud (FSC, etc.) | Custom Object | vlocity / OmniStudio |
|-----------|---------------------------|---------------|----------------------|
| **Use case fit** | Industry-standard entity exists (Policy, Claim, Patient) | Truly unique business entity | Configurable industry process |
| **License** | Industry Cloud SKU | Sales/Service base | Industry Cloud + OmniStudio |
| **Out-of-box features** | Yes (relationships, page layouts, reports) | None — build everything | Yes (DataPacks, OmniScripts) |
| **Future roadmap fit** | Aligned with SFDC release cadence | Independent (you maintain) | Aligned with industry packages |
| **Customization cost** | Lower (configure) | Higher (build from zero) | Lowest (configure DataPack) |
| **Best for** | Standard industry entities | Truly differentiated business objects | Industry vertical processes |
| **Anti-pattern** | Custom Account__c when FSC FinancialAccount fits | Forcing FSC object into wrong-shaped use case | OmniStudio for trivial Flow logic |

> Add scenario-specific matrices in Phase 4/5 as decisions arise. Matrix discipline: ≥3 columns, ≥4 rows, "Best for" + "Anti-pattern" rows mandatory.

