## EVIDENCE-BOUND OUTPUTS

Every decision must cite its source. Use these formats:

| Decision Type | Evidence Format |
|---------------|----------------|
| Decision from user input | "Per scenario: '{quote from intake}'" |
| Decision from RFP/BRD | "Per RFP §{N}: '{quote}'" |
| Decision from discovery Q&A | "Per Phase 0 Q&A: User confirmed '{answer}'" |
| ⚠️ ASSUMPTION | "⚠️ ASSUMPTION: {value} — Inferred because {reason}; user did not specify {gap}" |
| GAP | "GAP: Unable to confirm {detail} after {N} discovery attempts" |
| Industry default | "Industry default: {value} (typical for {industry/scale})" |

