## NUMERIC VERIFICATION (Gap #13 — MANDATORY for §9 Scalability)

Every numeric claim in Section 9 MUST show explicit arithmetic. Format:

```
Claim:        {result, e.g., "2.9 TPS sustained, 14.5 TPS peak"}
Inputs:       {daily volume, burst factor, time window} — source: {scenario / RFP §X}
Arithmetic:   {full calculation, e.g., "50,000 ÷ 86,400 sec = 0.579 TPS sustained;
                                          × 5x burst factor = 2.89 TPS peak"}
Sanity check: {compare to SFDC limits, e.g., "Apex async: 250K/day per user license;
                                              Platform Event: 250K events/24h base;
                                              well within limits"}
```

The validation script (`validate-solution-doc.js`) flags numeric tokens (TPS, /day, GB, ms) without an arithmetic block within ±10 lines.

