## LUCIDCHART INSTRUCTION CONVENTIONS (mandatory for Section 5)

Section 5 uses **text-based Lucidchart instructions**, NOT Mermaid. See `@00_Template_Configuration.mdc` Two Special Diagram Conventions for rationale.

### Standard Instruction Format

```markdown
## 5. Data Model Diagram (Lucidchart Instructions)

**Lucidchart setup:**
1. Create new Lucidchart document → Template: "Entity Relationship (ERD)"
2. Page setup: 11x17 landscape, 1-inch margins
3. Color legend (top-left text box):
   - 🟦 FSC Industry Cloud objects (Salesforce blue #1798C1)
   - 🟧 Custom objects (orange #FF6B35)
   - ⬜ External system entities (gray #666)

**Entity placement (top-down by domain):**
4. Top zone — POLICY domain:
   - Add `InsurancePolicy` entity (FSC, blue)
     - Fields: `PolicyNumber` (External ID), `EffectiveDate`, `Status`
   - Add `PolicyParticipant` entity (FSC, blue)
     - Fields: `Role`, `Percentage`
5. Middle zone — CLAIM domain:
   - Add `Claim` entity (FSC, blue)
     - Fields: `ClaimNumber` (External ID), `LossDate`, `Status`, `ReserveAmount`
   - Add `Guidewire_ClaimMirror__c` entity (Custom, orange)
     - Fields: `Guidewire_Claim_ID__c` (External ID), `LastSyncedAt__c`
{...continue for all entities}

**Relationships (after entities placed):**
N. `InsurancePolicy` 1—* `Claim` (one policy, many claims)
   - Cardinality label: "1..*"
   - Line style: solid black
N+1. `Claim` 1—1 `Guidewire_ClaimMirror__c` (one-to-one mirror)
   - Cardinality label: "1..1"
   - Line style: dashed gray (external sync)
{...continue for all relationships}

**Annotations:**
- Add legend in bottom-right
- Mark PHI fields with 🔒 icon
- Sharing model annotations on Claim entity (OWD: Private)
```

### What Makes Good Lucidchart Instructions

- ✅ Numbered steps (sequential, no skipping)
- ✅ Explicit shape type, color, position
- ✅ Field list per entity (not just entity name)
- ✅ Relationship cardinality + line style
- ✅ Color-coding rationale stated
- ❌ NEVER include raw Lucidchart XML or paste-shapes — instructions only
- ❌ NEVER produce a Mermaid block in Section 5

